.TH PVE-CLOUDINIT-EXTRAS-PATCH 8
.SH NAME
pve-cloudinit-extras-patch \- apply or remove the pve-cloudinit-extras hooks in pve-manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pve-cloudinit-extras-patch
.RB [ gui | api | all ]
.BR apply | remove | status
.SH DESCRIPTION
Adds (apply) or removes (remove) the marker lines that load the pve-cloudinit-extras GUI in
.I /usr/share/pve-manager/index.html.tpl
and register its API in
.IR /usr/share/perl5/PVE/API2/Nodes.pm .
The package runs this from its maintainer scripts and dpkg triggers; running it by hand is only
needed after changing
.IR /etc/pve-cloudinit-extras.conf .
.PP
apply leaves a file stock if the installed pve-manager version is not listed in
.I /usr/share/pve-cloudinit-extras/supported
or its anchor line is not found exactly once. remove deletes the marker lines and checks the file
against pve-manager's md5sums, restoring it from the pve-manager .deb if it differs.
Both always exit 0; the outcome is logged to syslog and shown by status.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/pve-cloudinit-extras.conf
FORCE=1 ignores the version list (for testing a new pve-manager).
.br
SKIP_LOAD_TEST=1 skips loading the patched Nodes.pm (for test containers without the full PVE stack).
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/lhns/pve-cloudinit-extras
